Whiteflow Merchant MCP (packages/mcp). Its stdio entry and server layout (src/index.ts, src/server.ts: one McpServer
with modular register functions) started from Pixa (https://github.com/soumyacodes007/Pixa, commit a06fae5).
Since batch 052 none of Pixa's wallet, payment, spending-limit or report code is in this package: the spending
limiter, the pay tool and the spending report that were adapted from it were removed. The notice is kept for the
layout's provenance. Pixa's licence follows.

